  <summary>High-performance reverse proxy and web server</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Veil is a reverse proxy and web server for HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3. It serves static files, proxies to
      HTTP, HTTPS, gRPC and WebSocket backends with load balancing and health checks, and can be extended with
      Proxy-Wasm plugins.
    </p>
    <p>
      On Linux it uses io_uring and kernel TLS, and it confines itself with seccomp and Landlock.
    </p>
